* Jet axis.

Figure II.4: Illustration of the Gluon Radiation due to Turbulent Color Fields theory; multiple soft rescatterings preceded by a hard scatterings[13].

- Distance traveled by the produced partons from the primary vertex along \(\hat{n}\).
* Maximum allowed value for \(\zeta\); the distance from \(r\) to the surface.
* \(l_{\perp}^{2}/(2p_{T_{2}}z_{1})\) the inverse formation time of a gluon with momentum \(l_{\perp}\) transverse to \(\hat{n}\).
